1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
With elf spirits possessing the bodies of magic knights and attacking humans, the royal capital found itself mired in chaos.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Inside the Eye of the Midnight Sun's hideout, Luck and some of the others turned against their fellow royal knights.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
And Asta's words about finding common ground weren't enough to convince Raya to stop the violence from unfolding further.

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Let's foster understanding.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
There were no lies in anything that he said, and so I trusted him.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
And what did it get me?

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
That.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
So you see, I'm done with trusting.

12
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Ryl, is that you?

13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Hey Raya! Good to see ya!

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Raya!

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
All of them, too?

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
We won't last five minutes against them.

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
After pulling Asta and Zora from the fight for their own safety,

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Marilyona faced their foes alone.

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
You seem like a benevolent leader, Madam Royal.

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
You don't understand a thing, do you?

21
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
I sent those novices home because they were getting in my way.

22
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Slow you down.

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Don't make me laugh.

24
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,000
I wanted the chance to obliterate all of you personally!

25
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
I want you personally!

26
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,000
I want you personally!

27
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
I want you personally!

28
00:01:46,000 --> 00:02:15,980
Wiedersehen.

29
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,500
and

30
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,500
What is your body?

31
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,500
I feel you're feeling your feet

32
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:26,500
I'm in the blue sky in the sky

33
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:29,500
The sky is bright and blue

34
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:32,500
The way you're crying and cry

35
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:36,500
I'm waiting, waiting, waiting, waiting

36
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:38,500
Don't leave me alone

37
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:41,500
I'm going to fly away

38
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:44,500
I'm going to try again

39
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:47,500
I'm waiting, waiting, waiting

40
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:50,500
Unlike the same part

41
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:52,500
I want an eye on the glasses

42
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,500
Your tears are sitä

43
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,500
I want to hear your feelings

44
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:58,500
That's the essence!

45
00:02:58,500 --> 00:02:59,500
I'm not Stephanie

46
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,500
Baby Rising

47
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:18,260
What in the world's happening out there?

48
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:22,380
I'm not sure. All I know is we have to keep Surfway Goleon safe.

49
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:34,180
That's the best you humans can do? You're useless, even as a group.

50
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:38,160
What's gotten into you, Vice-Captain Randall? Please stop this!

51
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:43,580
Not going to happen. I'll keep fighting until every one of you humans is destroyed.

52
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:47,340
And besides, my name's not Randall, so stop calling me that.

53
00:03:47,780 --> 00:03:49,960
His magic power is insanely strong!

54
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:53,540
It's no use. We're dead. There's no way we can win.

55
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,220
Don't give me that!

56
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,740
Did you forget?

57
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:03,380
We were trained by the two greatest Magic Knight Captains who ever lived.

58
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:08,140
We are the proud and mighty squad known as the Crimson Lion Kings!

59
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:12,760
Giving up and losing are two things we don't do!

60
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,420
Are you sure about that?

61
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:22,540
I've saturated the entire area with air magic.

62
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:27,020
And as such, you can't even cast a proper spell.

63
00:04:28,860 --> 00:04:34,160
Randall always used to add air to my flame magic to fan the fire and make my abilities more powerful.

64
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,500
Who knew we would be such a tough enemy?

65
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:41,020
Doesn't matter. I'll win and bring you back to your senses!

66
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,120
Focus.

67
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,120
Flame magic!

68
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,240
Viral flame!

69
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:53,080
Look at that! You did manage it!

70
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:57,180
But unfortunately, I have air magic.

71
00:04:57,660 --> 00:04:58,860
Air blockade!

72
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:05,400
Don't bother with those puny flames. I'll just blow them out like a candle.

73
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:08,480
Now, air magic! Crushing air blast technique!

74
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,580
Come on!

75
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,360
Leo!

76
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:22,020
Come on, be a good boy. It'll be easier for everyone if you would just drop dead already.

77
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,980
I'm not gonna lose.

78
00:05:25,740 --> 00:05:29,520
The fire of the Crimson Lion Kings can never be put out.

79
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:32,500
Not by you or anyone!

80
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:36,340
I'm with Leo on this one.

81
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,500
We'll combine the strength of all our senior ranked mages.

82
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:42,460
Let's remind our Vice Captain who he really is!

83
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:42,820
Right!

84
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:48,380
I say we start off with my iron creation magic, iron bullet!

85
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,600
And flame magic, burst javelin!

86
00:05:52,180 --> 00:05:55,060
Try stone magic, solid rock spell!

87
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:58,040
We'll show you the valor of the Crimson Lion Kings!

88
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:03,760
You humans are a stubborn bunch.

89
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,340
No matter how many of you come at me at once, you're all done for.

90
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:14,700
You can't run!

91
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:19,680
It's time to take care of the other side.

92
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:21,500
Air magic.

93
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,700
Explosive air weight, Paul!

94
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:26,680
14!

95
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:38,400
He moves his body through the sky by kicking, then he attacks with invisible chunks of the atmosphere itself.

96
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:42,020
Talk about a solid strategy. No one can touch him.

97
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,680
Air magic.

98
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,020
Crushing air blast!

99
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:54,840
Even a team of senior ranked mages isn't enough to defeat him now.

100
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,300
If only Sir Foygolion could help...

101
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:58,220
Don't say that!

102
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,460
Our skills are being put to the test.

103
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,620
This time, we're the ones who need to protect him.

104
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,900
Stay strong, mages!

105
00:07:09,020 --> 00:07:11,600
If we can survive this barrage, then we have a chance to counter!

106
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,060
No, you won't.

107
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,240
Found you!

108
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:20,880
Trained by the best, huh?

109
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,020
It sure didn't help you much.

110
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,040
That's it!

111
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:35,780
Thought you'd take me by surprise, did you?

112
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:40,660
It seemed like you were beginning to cooperate, but you were just waiting for your shot.

113
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,440
Here, this'll show you.

114
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:45,020
Now, air magic crushing air blast!

115
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:49,220
Don't trust your eyes. Feel it!

116
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,600
He dodged it!

117
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:54,780
Well.

118
00:07:54,780 --> 00:08:02,340
With so much mana here, the most effective way to win against air magic is to read the mana itself.

119
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:05,900
I may have been standing by, but it wasn't out of fear.

120
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,800
I'm starting to observe more and more.

121
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:13,760
I've come to understand the calm within the flame.

122
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:16,820
Don't get cocky over a little fluke.

123
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:20,200
Air magic exclusive air wave palm!

124
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:36,940
Your attack hit mine head on, which cut their damages in half.

125
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:41,800
And you immediately cast the flame chaser as I was dodging the impact.

126
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:47,020
Perhaps it wasn't a fluke then.

127
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,620
Great skill and fast growth.

128
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:52,820
Just what I expect from someone with royal blood.

129
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,300
You can say that again.

130
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:59,480
Leo, there's no doubt you're going to become the leader of this squad someday.

131
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:01,740
So let us buy you a little time.

132
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,740
Please, get out of this place and live.

133
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,120
Take the wounded with you.

134
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,120
Guys, no.

135
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,440
We're teammates.

136
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:09,200
I can stay and fight by your side.

137
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:09,980
Run.

138
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:11,280
Hurry.

139
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,860
Our squad's counting on you.

140
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:18,260
We are the honorable and courageous Crimson Lion Kings.

141
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:21,240
So for the sake of our comrades and the nation we love,

142
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,840
we will eliminate this threat without fear.

143
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:24,900
Yes, sir.

144
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:25,840
Gareth.

145
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:30,620
I can't just abandon you.

146
00:09:31,580 --> 00:09:34,780
We'll all survive this battle together.

147
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,360
It's so close.

148
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:39,080
I can almost reach out and touch it.

149
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:47,860
But my body won't.

150
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:48,960
Leo!

151
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,860
Your breakthrough came a moment too late, I'm afraid.

152
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:59,960
As you can see by your sudden inability to stand,

153
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:03,860
using an unfamiliar fighting style like that as a drain on the old stamina.

154
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:06,720
And you're supposed to be their leader one day?

155
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:10,000
Well, I'll just ensure that day never comes.

156
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,140
Damn it!

157
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:11,980
No!

158
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:14,600
Come on, body, move!

159
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,180
Don't do it!

160
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:26,080
Soon, all humans will die brutal deaths, especially royals like you.

161
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:28,100
I won't give up!

162
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:30,000
How could I?

163
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:34,540
I made a promise!

164
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:37,640
There's no way I'm gonna die!

165
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:39,040
Not now!

166
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:40,020
Not here!

167
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,900
Come on!

168
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:43,740
Please stand up!

169
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:48,580
Whoa!

170
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:51,600
What kind of weird mana is this?

171
00:10:51,600 --> 00:11:03,620
Where'd that come from?

172
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:04,900
More enemies?

173
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:05,880
No.

174
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:08,660
It feels warm.

175
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:11,420
Like a flame that's enveloping everything.

176
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:25,160
You fought well, Leo.

177
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,300
I'm proud.

178
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,420
I can't believe you're here.

179
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:34,140
But you have much to learn.

180
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,760
Stay back.

181
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,220
I'll handle this.

182
00:11:37,220 --> 00:11:45,280
That mana, it feels so familiar.

183
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:51,740
Salamander?

184
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,220
How did you...

185
00:11:54,080 --> 00:12:02,120
As head of the Crimson Lion Kings, and as your older brother, I will be bested no more!

186
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:13,460
Where am I?

187
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,380
I feel it.

188
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:21,260
The blazing mana of Leo and the others.

189
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:24,700
I have to come to their aid.

190
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,440
It's my responsibility.

191
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:29,800
Both as a magic knight, and as the captain of our brave squad.

192
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:35,100
Can't you not endure?

193
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:38,240
Is this the extent of your so-called power?

194
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:40,120
Fue go le on for millions!

195
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,800
Could this be...

196
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,480
The fire spirit, Salamander?

197
00:12:54,480 --> 00:13:07,680
From now on, I won't allow anyone to stand in my way.

198
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:16,100
Though I may have lost my arm, though flames may scorch my body, as long as there are people waiting for me.

199
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:23,620
The captain of the Crimson Lion Kings, Fue go le on vermilion, will press on!

200
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:31,840
What's this?

201
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:36,820
It fills me with both life and mana.

202
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:46,460
Perhaps there's something left that I'm meant to do.

203
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,080
Is that what you're telling me?

204
00:13:57,380 --> 00:13:59,880
Fire spirit, mark my words.

205
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:02,080
I swear to use your power well.

206
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,780
I apologize for the delay.

207
00:14:05,780 --> 00:14:06,840
It's all right.

208
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:10,960
I knew my brother wouldn't let a scratch like that keep him away forever.

209
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,580
All of you have thought valiantly.

210
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:19,980
Even while I was deep in slumber, the brilliant blazing of your mana was able to reach me.

211
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,820
Thank goodness you're alive!

212
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:25,120
Right.

213
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,820
That's the fire spirit, Salamander.

214
00:14:29,820 --> 00:14:33,780
Asla said it used to be partnered with a top member of the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

215
00:14:33,780 --> 00:14:37,080
Then one day it just disappeared in the middle of a battle.

216
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,780
My brother is honest and determined.

217
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:42,880
He has a trusted reputation.

218
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:46,780
He's a grand magic knight and the eldest son of the royal house vermilion.

219
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:50,780
When you put all those things together, why wouldn't Salamander have wanted him?

220
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:53,540
A human for a partner?

221
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,200
How is that possible?

222
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:57,200
And a royal at that.

223
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:59,300
They're the most corrupt of them all.

224
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:01,300
Randall!

225
00:15:03,780 --> 00:15:06,640
I've just awakened so my flames may be unruly.

226
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:09,420
Stand firm so you won't be consumed.

227
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:10,560
Is that so?

228
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:14,540
Even if you were chosen by a spirit, you're still pathetic human trashed.

229
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:17,880
No matter what you do, you'll never outmatch an elf!

230
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:19,920
You've got this!

231
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:24,420
Casting flame spirit magic, Salamander's breath!

232
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:32,280
These flames are too powerful!

233
00:15:32,780 --> 00:15:34,260
I can't blow them out!

234
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:36,460
I'm about to choke from the heat!

235
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:37,420
The air!

236
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,940
He's taking everything from me!

237
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:43,720
Damn you, royal!

238
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:49,060
Now, flame-binding magic, Leo home!

239
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:57,240
I had to stamp out this evil, even if the vice-captain's body was damaged.

240
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:58,360
You're back!

241
00:15:58,660 --> 00:15:59,200
Thank you.

242
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,540
We're saved!

243
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,300
Surf by Tholeon!

244
00:16:02,540 --> 00:16:05,240
You really are the greatest magic knight there is!

245
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:06,800
Hurry!

246
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,020
Help the injured!

247
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:08,740
Right!

248
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,500
That was awesome!

249
00:16:11,060 --> 00:16:12,420
My brother still got it!

250
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:14,940
I'm going to be even better one of these days, though!

251
00:16:16,860 --> 00:16:20,980
As your captain, I solemnly vowed that she will be returned to your former self.

252
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:21,980
Oh, yeah!

253
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:25,640
While you were out of commission, our sister became the captain!

254
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:26,780
She what?

255
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:28,660
Is this true?

256
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,120
Um, yes, sir.

257
00:16:30,740 --> 00:16:33,240
That's what happened, former Captain Foigolion!

258
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:37,020
Our sister, eh?

259
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,940
She should have been our captain in the first place.

260
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:43,680
But she couldn't even be bothered to join the magic knights.

261
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:47,540
Seems I've forced her to act out of character.

262
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:56,740
Salamander has made me aware of the sinister, non-human magic power that's been permeating the royal capital.

263
00:16:57,860 --> 00:17:01,260
While I've been asleep, the situation's intensified a great deal.

264
00:17:01,260 --> 00:17:10,980
When the eye of the midnight sun ransacked the city that day, I knew that I was the person they were targeting.

265
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:14,420
That's why I decided to play right into their hands.

266
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:16,260
Strange.

267
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,460
What is this place?

268
00:17:17,460 --> 00:17:23,420
It's you!

269
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,200
This mana?

270
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:28,220
William Vangent's?

271
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,360
I don't understand.

272
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,940
It appears you've arrived.

273
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:38,000
I had hoped you would surmise our plan and not come here.

274
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:41,120
I prayed for that.

275
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,120
Please explain yourself.

276
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,760
Tell me the truth.

277
00:17:45,140 --> 00:17:45,820
What plan?

278
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:47,260
You will see.

279
00:17:47,780 --> 00:17:48,960
Quite soon, in fact.

280
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:53,200
What is happening to you?

281
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:55,120
No one knows my secret.

282
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:58,200
Not even the Wizard King who gave me my mask.

283
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:02,700
But you will understand things when you see the other me.

284
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:04,100
Enough of this nonsense.

285
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:04,820
Who are you?

286
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:07,120
And what have you done to William?

287
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:08,420
Interesting.

288
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:10,980
The captain of the Crimson Lion Kings.

289
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:13,400
You're normally so collected.

290
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:15,540
But now even you seem shaken.

291
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:18,320
All I need is an instant.

292
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:22,980
Get him.

293
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:30,520
I have so many questions.

294
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:33,000
Why didn't he kill me when he had the chance?

295
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:34,920
Who was that person?

296
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,160
And what has become of William?

297
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:38,820
However,

298
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:42,620
I won't be the word of this matter until I can ascertain the truth.

299
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:45,220
Crimson Lion Kings!

300
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:47,620
Clover Kingdom is in grave danger.

301
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:50,060
We must end this bloodshed.

302
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:54,100
With the fires of strength and pride that burn deep within our hearts,

303
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,500
we will strive to vanquish the enemy.

304
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:57,360
Hurrah!

305
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:00,780
The real fight is just beginning.

306
00:19:07,740 --> 00:19:08,260
Hmm.

307
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:12,680
These outfits are awfully similar to the garment worn by that human royal.

308
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,040
That's strange, isn't it?

309
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:19,760
I'm sure the person who gathered us here made that decision.

310
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,920
Talk about a sick sense of humor.

311
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:24,140
I'm not sure I follow you.

312
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:27,800
