320
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:46,900
I was trapped in a pretty strange place when I awakened.

321
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,060
But I had fun getting out.

322
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:51,820
Humans infuriate me.

323
00:19:52,300 --> 00:19:54,140
Always so smug in their stupidity.

324
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:58,420
I'm assuming your cousin was the one who brought us together, right, Lahtry?

325
00:19:58,840 --> 00:19:59,320
Correct.

326
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:00,780
This is all Potry's doing.

327
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:05,920
Birds of a twisted feather flock together, I suppose.

328
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:10,360
And now I'm itching to get my hands around the throats of those despicable royal scum.

329
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:12,600
The midnight sun is set.

330
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:16,880
It's time to show humankind the wrath of a brand new golden dawn.

